Conflicts: niri
Replaces: niri
Description: Scrollable-tiling Wayland compositor with Biri enhancements
 Biri is a fork of niri with vertical scrolling, post-process shaders,
 animated focus rings, a multi-monitor carousel overview and other additions.
 The package retains the niri executable and configuration paths.
